"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even the busy Griffin base has its quiet moments."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Like now, for instance."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"When the clock strikes 12, some of the Dolls who have finished their training return to the dorms."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Of course, other Dolls are preparing to head out at this moment."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Aliana is one of the latter group."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, an uninvited guest blocks the doorway."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-80"}}],"ops":[{"type":"gradientShow","value":"2","raw":"GradientShow"}],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Good morning, SCAR-L, or should I say, Sergeant Aliana."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Up so early for work? You really are a legendary Doll."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-80"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Aliana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-80"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Unfortunately, Dolls nowadays don't understand what legends are. Your teammates just went to complain to the Commander."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"(Sigh) There was so much weeping and gnashing of teeth, it hurt my heart just to watch it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-80"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"To think that on the first day of returning to modern society, a legendary Doll would end up as an officer with no men."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Aliana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If you're here to tell me about this, I already know."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Aliana's face reveals no emotion. She nods and prepares to leave, but Dandelion looms in front of her again, like a clingy ex."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-80"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not the same as those Dolls who only have processing speeds of 128kb/s. I'm quite interested in you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-80"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Aliana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Because we use different systems?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-80"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, but that's not all."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I've been watching you ever since you heroically took down our Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-80"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Aliana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And what is your conclusion from the day's observations?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-80"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can't read you, Sergeant Aliana."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-80"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Aliana","narrator":false,"pages":[{